<p>Fire a shot at the target tile that blinds enemies for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> turns, marks them for 2 turns and illuminates the area within radius 2 for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns. Enemies within the illuminated area lose <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Dexterity 100">22, 29, 34, 38, 42</acronym> defence and stealth power and cannot benefit from concealment.</p><p>The status chance increases with your Accuracy, and the defense reduction with your Dexterity.</p>